# Guard film: walking at the three speeds (slow, normal, fast) in one straight line, the walk changing between them
# while the ant goes on (the change must wait for the moment both walks are at the same point of the step: no pop).
# Run all guard films: python tools/guard_films.py run   (see that file's top comment)
cmd time set noon
cmd weather clear
lens 30
walker worker_ant -9.5 -60 0.5 -90
log walk
cmd tick freeze
fov 10
follow 0 0.15 -5 0 0
go -4 -60 0 0.4
burst slow 40 1
go 2 -60 0 1.0
burst normal 30 1
go 10 -60 0 1.8
burst fast 30 1
log off
follow off
quit
